{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39599","headline":"万寿寺牡丹 · 翁承赞","name":"万寿寺牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂熳香风引贵游，高僧移步亦迟留。\n可怜殿角长松色，不得王孙一举头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}